2931:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2932:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2933:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
