2938:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
2939:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
